# hypernix.pepper_shaker

3-tier sharp perturbations: SmallShaker (MLM-mask) / Dish (typos) / TallHandmade (negation).

## Documentation pages

No dedicated guide has been published for this subsystem yet. See the API reference and source module.

## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `SmallShaker()`

Random word masking at ``rate``. Replaces whole whitespace-

### `Dish()`

Typo injection. For each word with probability ``rate``,

### `TallHandmade()`

Negation injection. Prepends ``negator`` (\"NOT \" by default)

### `pepper_shaker(tier, source, **kw) -> Shaker`

Construct a pepper-shaker tier by short name.

